flowchart LR
  Q[Queue claim] --> F[Runtime factory]
  F --> V[Strict state identity size secret and version validation]
  V --> T[Server-derived tenant/run thread]
  T --> L{Single-resumer lease}
  L --> G[Deterministic LangGraph node]
  G --> C[Guarded Postgres checkpoint]
  C --> A[Registry audit metrics]
  C -->|worker dies| R[Replacement worker resume]
  R --> V
  V -->|invalid or cross-tenant| X[Stable fail-closed error]
  K[Global kill switch] -->|blocks new invocation only| F
